# A LAN session, the Mac joining (tools/lan/mac_session.py run join):
# main menu -> Multiplayer -> Other Multiplayer -> the LAN page and its game
# list, then the steps appended to the live file (@LIVE@ is replaced by its
# path): pick the other machine's game, Join Game, chat, Ready, the game.
timeout 3600000
pointer f32 [0x9197a8]+4 [0x9197a8]+8
hold 250
wait frames 30
moveby 1 1
wait 300

click 511 371                 # Multiplayer
wait change within 30000
wait 2000
dump won

pointer system
click 618 644                 # Other Multiplayer
wait change within 20000
wait 3000
dump lan                      # the game list
log at the LAN page; following the live file
follow @LIVE@
